  "priorExpiration": "2004-09-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6306.01 Laboratory Accreditation, Independent Analysis. Any laboratory that performs an analysis of a captured sample to determine its alcohol concentration pursuant to RSA 265-A:7, shall be accredited by a nationally recognized accrediting body pursuant to RSA 265-A:5, V.\n\nSource. #8064, INTERIM, eff 4-1-04, EXPIRES: 9-28-04 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6300); ss by #8114, eff 7-14-04; ss by #9683, eff 3-23-10; renumbered by #12064 (formerly Saf-C 6305.01)",
